  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "local-tool-approval-host-only",
      "impact": "breaking",
      "summary": "Tool-authorization approvals are Host-only by default (#1101): the control socket and byok-agent approve can no longer approve them; rejection is unaffected. Set DaemonConfig.localToolApproval: 'allow' to restore local tool-authorization approval.",
      "migration": "docs/security.md#3-shared-approval-path",
      "items": [
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#APPROVAL_REQUIRES_HOST",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#ApprovalKind",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#DaemonConfig",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#DiagnosticsSnapshot",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#LocalToolApprovalPolicy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "auth-renewal-floor",
      "impact": "additive",
      "summary": "Token renewal keeps a minimum gap between proactive renewals, so a fast device clock or a server TTL under the renewal margin no longer loops renewals and keychain writes (#1114). The declarations change only by private AuthManager members; no Host action.",
      "migration": "https://github.com/Ancienttwo/byok-sdk/pull/1131",
      "items": [
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#BlobClient",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#InstallSkillPacksOptions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "store-compatibility-precheck",
      "impact": "additive",
      "summary": "Read-only store compatibility precheck (#1102). Before switching versions, run the candidate build's inspectors to learn whether it accepts each local store, needs a new path and pairing (new-path-repair), or refuses it (rejected): inspectDaemonStores (@byok-sdk/client, journal and pi-durable replicas; also `byok-agent upgrade check --store [--json]`, exit 2 when a store would be refused), inspectSqliteStore (@byok-sdk/server) and inspectProviderProfileStore (@byok-sdk/keys), all returning the StoreCompatibility type from @byok-sdk/core. Each one opens only a private temporary copy of the files.",
      "migration": "docs/upgrade-manifest.md#store-compatibility-precheck",
      "items": [
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#InspectDaemonStoresInput",
        "export:@byok-sdk/client#inspectDaemonStores",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#LocalStoreId",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#StoreCompatibility",
        "export:@byok-sdk/core#StoreCompatibilityVerdict",
        "export:@byok-sdk/keys#inspectProviderProfileStore",
        "export:@byok-sdk/server#inspectSqliteStore"
      ]
    }
  ],
